{
	"info": {
		"name": "BuildWeek Back-End 3 - CRM",
		"description": "Auth + Users + Addresses + Clients + Notes CRUD.\n\nFlujo sugerido:\n1. Auth > Register admin\n2. Auth > Register user\n3. Auth > Register temp (para borrar)\n4. Auth > Login admin  (guarda {{accessToken}} automaticamente, necesario para Addresses/Clients/Notes)\n5. Users > cualquier request (usa el Bearer token de la coleccion)\n6. Addresses > Create address (legal)  (guarda {{addressId}})\n7. Addresses > Create address (temp, para borrar)  (guarda {{tempAddressId}})\n8. Clients > Create client  (usa {{addressId}}, guarda {{clientId}})\n9. Clients > Create client (temp, para borrar)  (guarda {{tempClientId}})\n10. Notes > Create note  (usa {{clientId}}, guarda {{noteId}})\n\nNota: crear/editar/borrar Addresses requiere rol ADMIN o COMMERCIALE (borrar solo ADMIN); crear Notes requiere ser el referente COMMERCIALE del cliente o ADMIN. El flujo por defecto usa siempre el token de admin.\n\nVariables de coleccion:\n- baseUrl: http://localhost:2462\n- accessToken: lo setea el login\n- userId: id para probar GET/PUT/PATCH por id\n- tempUserId: id del usuario temp, para el DELETE\n- addressId / tempAddressId: ids de indirizzi creados\n- clientId / tempClientId: ids de clientes creados\n- noteId: id de la nota creada",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{accessToken}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:2462"
		},
		{
			"key": "accessToken",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "userId",
			"value": "1"
		},
		{
			"key": "tempUserId",
			"value": "3"
		},
		{
			"key": "addressId",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "tempAddressId",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "clientId",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "tempClientId",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "noteId",
			"value": ""
		}
	],
